      GraphCert.Quartic.Polynomial.value F x y * GraphCert.Quartic.Polynomial.value starA_5 x y + values x y 5 * GraphCert.Quartic.Polynomial.value starB_5 x y :=
  identity_power (neighbors 5) nodes (constants 5) F starA_5 starB_5 root_5 5 1 4 (by decide +kernel) x y

