    (1 : G)^4 * rowProduct (neighbors 50) (values x y) (constants 50) - GraphCert.Quartic.Polynomial.value root_50 x y ^ 4 =
      GraphCert.Quartic.Polynomial.value F x y * GraphCert.Quartic.Polynomial.value starA_50 x y + values x y 50 * GraphCert.Quartic.Polynomial.value starB_50 x y :=
  identity_power (neighbors 50) nodes (constants 50) F starA_50 starB_50 root_50 50 1 4 (by decide +kernel) x y

